title: FightIntro
---
<<declare $friend1Name = "Branko">>

<<wait 1>>

As Marc leaves the Bakery, he notices a crowd of people gathering.
They're all wearing sports jerseys and start to argue amongst each other, which leads to them pushing each other around.

{$friend1Name}: Hey {$charName}! How was your first day?
{$charName}: Pretty interesting, although I get the impression that my boss doesn't like me that much.
{$charName}: Overall, the day wasn't bad. I did have some interesting conversations.
{$charName}: You know Petar, right?
{$friend1Name}: I can't say I know Petar personally, but he always seemed grumpy.
{$charName}: I can see why you'd think that.

The crowd is getting louder and shoving has turned into throwing punches.

{$friend1Name}: Sorry, {$charName}, I have to take care of this.

{$friend1Name} runs off, right up to the fight. {$charName} doesn't even have a chance to respond.
{$charName} watches for a moment before turning to continue heading home.

{$charName}: I should head home now.
===